<title>SOUTH KOREA: LG Metals in talks on Mali gold project.</title>
<headline>LG Metals in talks on Mali gold project.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>LG Metals Corp has been negotiating with Afko Korea Inc, which holds the right to develop a gold mine in Mali, to take a 51-percent stake in the mining project, officials at the two companies said on Friday.  </p>
<p>An official at Afko Korea said its subsidiary in Mali, Afko Inc, had been undergoing feasibility study on a mine in the African country.</p>
<p>South Korea's Naeway Economic Daily reported the mine was estimated to have reserves of about 400 tonnes.</p>
<p>But officials at the two companies declined to give details on the mine.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5646</p>
